The start screen quotes the Declaration of the Establishment of the State of Israel (14 May 1948): the Hebrew as
published in Iton Rishmi (Official Gazette) No. 1, and the official English translation of the Israel Ministry of Foreign
Affairs (https://www.gov.il/en/pages/declaration-of-establishment-state-of-israel). An official State publication, in the
public domain; sources in docs/sources/declaration-1948/.

