others, Unicode License v3 (https://www.unicode.org/license.txt).

Ben-Gurion's reading of the Declaration (unity/Assets/StreamingAssets/audio/declaration-1948-isa-00113hj.wav): an excerpt
of the recording of the ceremony of 14 May 1948, recorded by Ralph Hellinger of Radio Doctor, Israel State Archives, item
